data: {"id": "a6a2df3bfc2d4f79-thinking-parallel_evidence-2401", "run_id": "a6a2df3bfc2d4f79", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "从已有工具结果中，我们可以确认以下关键事实：\n\n## 1. Pod 当前状态和身份\n- **命名空间**: `aiops-case-11`\n- **Pod 名称**: `workload`\n- **Pod UID**: `1cc226c9-d72d-4505-a057-b5022eaf5111`\n- **所在 Node**: `node2` (Ready)\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.48`\n\n## 2. Terminating 状态确认\n- **deletionTimestamp**: `2026-09-07T23:09:46Z` (已设置删除时间戳)\n- **deletionGracePeriodSeconds**: `0` (宽限期为0)\n- **finalizers**: `aiops.lab/hold` (存在自定义 finalizer)\n- **phase**: `Running` (尽管有 deletionTimestamp，Phase 仍为 Running)\n\n**冲突**: Pod 有 `deletionTimestamp` 但 `phase`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 10, "ts_ms": 1788825719631, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

